  "notes": {
    "title": "Arena becomes the main game",
    "summary": "Normal and Hard are now the only regular run modes. This update starts everyone on a fresh profile and resets previous unlocks, gear, saved builds and active runs.",
    "changes": [
      "Start Normal or Hard from the hub. The original dungeon route and Champion Trials have been removed.",
      "Manage gear per heroine. Normal starts with a fresh skill build, and a winning build unlocks Hard for that heroine.",
      "Continue a saved Arena run from the hub. Gear carried into a run stays in the heroine\u2019s collection if you replace it during the run.",
      "Opt-in playtest reports now track Arena difficulty, clears, build choices and gear progression."
    ]
  }
